    "F2-manual-rule-faithful": "All public rules used by the named protocol/method branch are implemented, without claiming proprietary software equivalence.",
    "F3-compatible-approximate": "Internal compatible/inspired/heuristic logic. It must not be presented as the named external method and cannot drive Scientific-Strict primary decisions unless the decision impact is explicitly non-primary.",
